 * Mixture-of-Agents Aggregation (Genspark): Routes sub-tasks dynamically across 80+ top-tier foundation models (such as GPT-5.4, Claude Opus 4.6, Grok 4.5, and Nemotron) to maximize output quality.
 * Super Agent Task Decomposition (Genspark): Achieves high task autonomy (rated at 83%) by breaking down complex high-level intent into sequential sub-tasks across specialized sub-agents.
 * Auto-Scaling Project Retrieval Context (Claude): Expands context capacity up to 1,000,000 tokens while using automated vector search mode to search massive document stores without saturating active context windows.
